{"html":"<p>Almost every Java program keeps groups of things: users, orders, words, tasks. The collections framework gives you four main shapes for them. Pick the right one and your code gets shorter and faster. Pick the wrong one and you get slow lookups, duplicates or strange bugs.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-four-shapes\">The Four Shapes</h2>\n<div data-table-scroll><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Interface</th>\n<th>Holds</th>\n<th>Duplicates</th>\n<th>Typical class</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>List</code></td>\n<td>Items in order, reached by position</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td><code>ArrayList</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Set</code></td>\n<td>Unique items</td>\n<td>No</td>\n<td><code>HashSet</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Map</code></td>\n<td>Keys, each with one value</td>\n<td>Keys: no</td>\n<td><code>HashMap</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Queue</code></td>\n<td>Items waiting their turn</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n<td><code>ArrayDeque</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p>Declare variables with the interface and create them with a class: <code>List&lt;String&gt; names = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;();</code>. Then you can change the class later without touching the rest of your code.</p>\n<h2 id=\"list-items-in-order\">List: Items in Order</h2>\n<p>A list keeps items in the order you add them, and you can reach any item by its index, starting at 0.</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">List</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">names</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> ArrayList&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">names.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">add</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Ana\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">names.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">add</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Ben\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">names.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">add</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Ana\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(names);        </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// [Ana, Ben, Ana]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(names.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">get</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// Ben</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(names.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">size</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 3</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h3 id=\"arraylist-or-linkedlist\">ArrayList or LinkedList?</h3>\n<p>Use <code>ArrayList</code>. It keeps items in one array, so <code>get(i)</code> is instant and looping over it is fast, because the items sit next to each other in memory. <code>LinkedList</code> is only faster for adding and removing at the start of the list, and <code>ArrayDeque</code> does that better (see below). In practice you&#39;ll almost never need <code>LinkedList</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"set-unique-items\">Set: Unique Items</h2>\n<p>A set ignores duplicates, and answers &quot;is this in here?&quot; very quickly.</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">unique</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> HashSet&#x3C;>(names);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(unique.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">size</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">());          </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(unique.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">contains</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"Ben\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// true</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>There are three sets you&#39;ll use, and they differ in the order you get items back:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> HashSet&#x3C;>(List.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"pear\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"apple\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"fig\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">));       </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// any order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> TreeSet&#x3C;>(List.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"pear\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"apple\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"fig\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">));       </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// [apple, fig, pear]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> LinkedHashSet&#x3C;>(List.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"pear\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"apple\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"fig\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// [pear, apple, fig]</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><ul>\n<li><code>HashSet</code>: the fastest. <code>contains</code> takes about the same time with 10 items or 10 million. The order isn&#39;t defined: never rely on it.</li>\n<li><code>TreeSet</code>: keeps items sorted. A bit slower (lookups grow with the logarithm of the size), but you get <code>first()</code>, <code>last()</code> and ranges.</li>\n<li><code>LinkedHashSet</code>: as fast as <code>HashSet</code>, and remembers the order items were added.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"map-keys-and-values\">Map: Keys and Values</h2>\n<p>A map finds a value by its key, like a word in a dictionary. Putting a key that already exists replaces its value.</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Map</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">, </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">stock</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> HashMap&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">stock.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">put</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"apple\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">stock.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">put</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"pear\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">stock.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">put</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"apple\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(stock.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">get</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"apple\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">));            </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(stock.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">get</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"kiwi\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">));             </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(stock.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">getOrDefault</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"kiwi\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">)); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 0</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p><code>get</code> returns <code>null</code> for a missing key, which can cause a <code>NullPointerException</code> later. Use <code>getOrDefault</code>, or <code>containsKey</code> first.</p>\n<p>Counting things is the classic map job. <code>merge</code> adds 1 to the current count, or starts at 1:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Map</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">, </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">counts</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> TreeMap&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">for</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (String</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> word</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \"the cat and the hat\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">split</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\" \"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    counts.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">merge</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(word, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, Integer</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">::</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">sum);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(counts); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// {and=1, cat=1, hat=1, the=2}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">for</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (Map</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">.</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Entry</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">, </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">entry</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> counts.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">entrySet</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">    System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(entry.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">getKey</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">() </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">+</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\"> \" -> \"</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> entry.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">getValue</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Maps come in the same three flavors as sets: <code>HashMap</code> (fastest, no order), <code>TreeMap</code> (sorted by key) and <code>LinkedHashMap</code> (in the order keys were added). In fact, <code>HashSet</code> is a <code>HashMap</code> that only uses the keys.</p>\n<h2 id=\"queue-and-deque-waiting-in-line\">Queue and Deque: Waiting in Line</h2>\n<p>A queue hands items out in the order they came in: first in, first out. A stack does the opposite: last in, first out. <code>ArrayDeque</code> does both.</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Queue</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">queue</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> ArrayDeque&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">queue.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">offer</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"first\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">queue.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">offer</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"second\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(queue.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">poll</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// first</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Deque</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">String</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">stack</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> ArrayDeque&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">stack.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">push</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"a\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">stack.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">push</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0A3069;--shiki-dark:#A5D6FF\">\"b\"</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(stack.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">pop</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// b</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>Don&#39;t use the old <code>Stack</code> class: it&#39;s slower, and <code>ArrayDeque</code> is what the Java docs recommend.</p>\n<p>When the most important item should come out first, not the oldest, use a <code>PriorityQueue</code>. It always hands out the smallest item (or the first by your own <code>Comparator</code>):</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">PriorityQueue</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">tasks</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> PriorityQueue&#x3C;>(List.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(tasks.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">poll</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// 1</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h2 id=\"which-one-should-i-use\">Which One Should I Use?</h2>\n<div data-table-scroll><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>You need to…</th>\n<th>Use</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Keep items in order, read them by position</td>\n<td><code>ArrayList</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Remove duplicates, check &quot;is it there?&quot; fast</td>\n<td><code>HashSet</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Keep unique items sorted</td>\n<td><code>TreeSet</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Find a value by a key</td>\n<td><code>HashMap</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Keep keys sorted, or find the nearest key</td>\n<td><code>TreeMap</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Keep the order things were added</td>\n<td><code>LinkedHashMap</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Process items in arrival order, or as a stack</td>\n<td><code>ArrayDeque</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Always take the smallest or most urgent first</td>\n<td><code>PriorityQueue</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"trap-1-changing-a-list-while-looping-over-it\">Trap 1: Changing a List While Looping Over It</h2>\n<p>Removing items inside a for-each loop throws a <code>ConcurrentModificationException</code>:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">List</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">numbers</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> ArrayList&#x3C;>(List.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">of</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">for</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (Integer</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> numbers) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">%</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) numbers.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">remove</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(n); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// ConcurrentModificationException</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>The loop notices that the list changed under it and stops. Use <code>removeIf</code> instead:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">numbers.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">removeIf</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(n </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">-></span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">%</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(numbers); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// [1, 3]</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><h2 id=\"trap-2-list-of-can-t-be-changed\">Trap 2: List.of Can&#39;t Be Changed</h2>\n<p><code>List.of</code>, <code>Set.of</code> and <code>Map.of</code> create collections you can&#39;t change. Calling <code>add</code> or <code>remove</code> on them throws an <code>UnsupportedOperationException</code>. That&#39;s useful for constants. When you need to change it, copy it first: <code>new ArrayList&lt;&gt;(List.of(&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;))</code>. They also refuse <code>null</code> items.</p>\n<h2 id=\"trap-3-your-own-objects-in-a-hashset-or-hashmap\">Trap 3: Your Own Objects in a HashSet or HashMap</h2>\n<p>A <code>HashSet</code> finds items with two methods: <code>hashCode()</code> picks where to look, then <code>equals()</code> checks the match. A class that doesn&#39;t override them compares objects by identity, so two objects with the same values look different:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">class</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> BadPoint</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">    final</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">, </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">    BadPoint</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">int</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">int</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">) { </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">.x </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> x; </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">.y </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> y; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">BadPoint</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">bad</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> HashSet&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">bad.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">add</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> BadPoint</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(bad.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">contains</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> BadPoint</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">))); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// false</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>The fix is to override both <code>equals</code> and <code>hashCode</code>, always together. The easiest way, since Java 16, is a record, which writes them for you:</p>\n<div data-code-panel><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light-default github-dark-default code-block\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">record</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">int</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> x, </span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">int</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> y) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">Set</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">Point</span><span style=\"color:#953800;--shiki-dark:#FFA657\">> </span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">good</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\"> HashSet&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">good.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">add</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">System.out.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">println</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(good.</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\">contains</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#CF222E;--shiki-dark:#FF7B72\">new</span><span style=\"color:#8250DF;--shiki-dark:#D2A8FF\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">, </span><span style=\"color:#0550AE;--shiki-dark:#79C0FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#1F2328;--shiki-dark:#E6EDF3\">))); </span><span style=\"color:#6E7781;--shiki-dark:#8B949E\">// true</span></span></code></pre><button type=\"button\" data-copy-code>Copy</button></div><p>One more rule: don&#39;t change a field used by <code>hashCode</code> while the object is inside a set or used as a map key. The set would look for it in the wrong place.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-answer-in-short\">The Answer in Short</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Declare with the interface (<code>List</code>, <code>Set</code>, <code>Map</code>, <code>Queue</code>), create with a class.</li>\n<li>Default to <code>ArrayList</code>, <code>HashSet</code>, <code>HashMap</code> and <code>ArrayDeque</code>.</li>\n<li>Use the <code>Tree…</code> versions for sorted data and the <code>LinkedHash…</code> versions to keep the insertion order.</li>\n<li>Remove items with <code>removeIf</code>, not inside a for-each loop.</li>\n<li>Objects used in a hash set or as map keys need <code>equals</code> and <code>hashCode</code>: use a record.</li>\n</ol>\n"}